"GSheetConnector WooCommerce Add-on requires WooCommerce plugin to be installed "
"and activated."
msgstr ""
"GSheetConnector WooCommerce Add-on vereist dat de WooCommerce-plugin is "
"geïnstalleerd en geactiveerd."

